{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"mappings\":[{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.11d4e8e1976eb5b2900022be\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.equal.threshold\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The case asks whether the express threshold route classifies the fund. The program asks whether either the threshold route or an operative designation supplies a contemporaneous classification basis. A particular route and the disjunction of both routes are different Boolean questions, even when the stipulated threshold would make both true.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV. On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.241bdcebd49036f3d3ad3a42\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.equal.threshold\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The case isolates classification by the express threshold. The unchanged program evaluates the disjunction of threshold satisfaction and operative designation. Agreement on this scenario does not make that broader predicate precisely the threshold question.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV. On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.11d4e8e1976eb5b2900022be\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.below.no.designation.evidence\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"Definite non-complex status is not the Boolean negation of a contemporaneous classification basis. The candidate expressly leaves historical classification persistence unresolved, and missing designation evidence cannot establish absence of designation. The program does not encode the case's certainty or status question.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.241bdcebd49036f3d3ad3a42\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.below.no.designation.evidence\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The program evaluates two current classification routes, expressly without establishing non-complex status or cessation of historical classification. Its negation therefore does not answer whether the fund is definitely non-complex. Unavailable designation evidence also remains uncertainty rather than a false designation fact.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.11d4e8e1976eb5b2900022be\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.excluded.laf\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The case asks whether this circular establishes classification for an excluded vehicle. The program's scope excludes LAFs and supplies no classification answer for them. A scope exclusion is not a Boolean result answering the case question.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"6 Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs).\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.241bdcebd49036f3d3ad3a42\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.excluded.laf\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The selected control returns a classification result only for an in-scope fund. The stipulated LAF is outside that scope; the program does not encode a separate Boolean question about whether the circular itself establishes classification for excluded vehicles.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"6 Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs).\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.11d4e8e1976eb5b2900022be\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.no.solicitation\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The case asks about a suitability requirement after classification, irrespective of solicitation or recommendation. The program evaluates classification bases and contains no suitability-duty predicate. Prior classification also does not identify which current classification route applies.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.241bdcebd49036f3d3ad3a42\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.no.solicitation\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"Suitability obligations following classification are distinct from the two classification routes encoded by this control. The program does not evaluate sales requirements or the effect of absence of solicitation or recommendation.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805\"}]}],\"unresolved\":[\"Neither candidate encodes the threshold route alone as its result; a shared true outcome at exactly 50% does not establish precise question alignment.\",\"The below-threshold scenario leaves operative designation unknown, and the candidates do not resolve historical classification persistence.\",\"Both candidates exclude LAFs from their scope and do not encode the suitability requirement.\"]}"}}
